If you’ve ever blamed yourself for gaining weight, you need to listen to this.

@drjasonfung explains how your environment shapes your eating habits more than you realize.

💌 Comment LISTEN and we’ll DM you the full conversation.

@drjasonfung, MD, is one of the leading voices challenging everything diet culture has taught women about food, weight, and willpower.

In this episode, he’s sitting down with @tamsenfadal on @thetamsenshow to debunk the “calories in, calories out” myth and reveal how hormones, ultra-processed foods, and different types of hunger play a much bigger role than we’ve been led to believe.

Available now wherever you get your podcasts. Prefer video? Search “The Tamsen Show” on YouTube.🧡

